1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,390
Look at a plane window.

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:02,704
See the tiny hole?

3
00:00:02,724 --> 00:00:03,424
Don't worry.

4
00:00:03,424 --> 00:00:04,775
It won't suck you out.

5
00:00:04,795 --> 00:00:06,455
A plane window is actually

6
00:00:06,455 --> 00:00:07,303
three panes.

7
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:08,723
Up high, the cabin air

8
00:00:08,723 --> 00:00:10,243
pushes hard against them.

9
00:00:10,263 --> 00:00:10,963
The hole sits

10
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:12,235
in the middle pane.

11
00:00:12,255 --> 00:00:13,375
It lets air through,

12
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:14,445
so the outer pane

13
00:00:14,445 --> 00:00:15,428
takes the pressure.

14
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:16,338
The middle pane

15
00:00:16,338 --> 00:00:17,245
is the backup.

16
00:00:17,265 --> 00:00:17,815
And the hole

17
00:00:17,815 --> 00:00:19,252
has one more job.

18
00:00:19,272 --> 00:00:20,842
It lets moisture escape,

19
00:00:20,842 --> 00:00:21,712
so your window

20
00:00:21,712 --> 00:00:22,563
doesn't fog up.

21
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:24,221
So you can enjoy the view.

22
00:00:24,241 --> 00:00:25,141
Follow for more

23
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:26,229
hidden designs.
